  "description": "A small, safe, bounded expression language over in-memory JSON (System.Text.Json): navigate with $-paths, filter arrays ([?field op operand]), evaluate boolean conditions and interpolate strings. A deliberately restricted subset — no recursion, functions or arithmetic — so it stays auditable. Includes SiftContext to assemble the root document from JsonNode/JsonElement/JsonDocument/POCOs.",
